# Number Guessing Game

A simple command-line Number Guessing Game written in C.

## Description

This program generates a random number between 1 and 100.

The player keeps guessing until the correct number is found.

After every incorrect guess, the program gives a hint:
- Guess a larger number
- Guess a smaller number

It also counts the number of attempts taken to guess the correct number.

## Features

- Random number generation
- User input
- Higher/Lower hints
- Counts total attempts
- Simple command-line interface

## Technologies Used

- C
- Visual Studio Code

